The probe tree did not exist, so it was created and the CLI exit-code contract was implemented end to end.

**Major process exits a calling script can branch on**

| Class | Code | Exit |
|---|---|---|
| usage error | `E_USAGE` | 2 |
| precondition failed | `E_PREFLIGHT` | 20 |
| validation failed | `E_CONFORM` | 51 |
| permission denied | `E_PERMISSION` | 16 |
| blocked-needs-owner | `E_DRIFT` | 30 |
| internal error | `E_INTERNAL` | 100 |

Exit 0 is reserved for verified success (`astplugin errors`). Taxonomy exits stay in 0..125 and do not collide with 126, 127, or 128+n.

